{
  "info": {
    "name": "CosmoQMS — CRUD Materias Primas (API REST v1)",
    "_postman_id": "6f0c1d2e-6a51-4a4f-9a8e-cosmoqms-crud",
    "description": "Pruebas del CRUD de materias primas de CosmoQMS: insertar (POST), consultar (GET), modificar (PATCH) y eliminar (DELETE), más los casos de error (validación 400, conflicto 409, no encontrado 404).\n\nRequisitos: stack de Docker arriba en modo demo con rol admin (`DEMO_ROLE=admin docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.demo.yml up -d`), y el entorno 'CosmoQMS local' seleccionado. Ejecutar en orden (Run collection): cada petición guarda los datos que necesita la siguiente.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Código único por corrida para que la colección se pueda repetir sin chocar con el anterior.",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('codigo')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('codigo', 'MP-PM-' + Date.now().toString().slice(-6));",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Salud del API",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('API y base de datos en línea', () => {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('ok');",
              "  pm.expect(body.database).to.eql('ok');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "health"] },
        "description": "Endpoint público de salud: confirma que la aplicación y PostgreSQL responden."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "01 · Consultar todas las materias primas (GET)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Devuelve la lista y su total', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an('array');",
              "  pm.expect(body.total).to.eql(body.data.length);",
              "});",
              "const conHistorial = body.data.find((m) => m.code === 'MP-001');",
              "if (conHistorial) pm.collectionVariables.set('materialConHistorialId', conHistorial.id);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('codigo', 'MP-PM-' + Date.now().toString().slice(-6));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materias-primas",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "materias-primas"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "02 · Insertar materia prima (POST)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Devuelve la materia prima creada con id', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(body.data.id).to.be.a('string');",
              "  pm.expect(body.data.code).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('codigo'));",
              "  pm.expect(body.data.name).to.eql('Pantenol USP');",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Incluye cabecera Location', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location')).to.eql('/api/v1/materias-primas/' + body.data.id);",
              "});",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('materialId', body.data.id);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{codigo}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Pantenol USP\",\n  \"unit\": \"kg\",\n  \"category\": \"humectante\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materias-primas",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "materias-primas"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "03 · Consultar materia prima por id (GET)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Es la materia prima recién creada', () => {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(body.data.id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('materialId'));",
              "  pm.expect(body.data.unit).to.eql('kg');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materias-primas/{{materialId}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "materias-primas", "{{materialId}}"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "04 · Modificar materia prima (PATCH)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Aplica solo los campos enviados', () => {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(body.data.name).to.eql('Pantenol USP (grado farmacéutico)');",
              "  pm.expect(body.data.category).to.eql('activo');",
              "  pm.expect(body.data.unit).to.eql('kg');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Pantenol USP (grado farmacéutico)\",\n  \"category\": \"activo\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materias-primas/{{materialId}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "materias-primas", "{{materialId}}"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "05 · Eliminar materia prima (DELETE)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Confirma la eliminación', () => {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(body.deleted).to.eql(true);",
              "  pm.expect(body.data.id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('materialId'));",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materias-primas/{{materialId}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "materias-primas", "{{materialId}}"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "06 · Verificar que ya no existe (GET → 404)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 404 Not Found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
              "pm.test('Mensaje de error claro', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('Materia prima no encontrada');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materias-primas/{{materialId}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "materias-primas", "{{materialId}}"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "07 · Validación: insertar sin nombre (POST → 400)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 400 Bad Request', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
              "pm.test('Señala el campo inválido', () => {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(body.issues.map((i) => i.path)).to.include('name');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"MP-SIN-NOMBRE\",\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"unit\": \"kg\"\n}" },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materias-primas",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "materias-primas"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "08 · Conflicto: código duplicado (POST → 409)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 409 Conflict', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
              "pm.test('Explica que el código ya existe', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.include('MP-001');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"MP-001\",\n  \"name\": \"Agua duplicada\",\n  \"unit\": \"kg\"\n}" },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materias-primas",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "materias-primas"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "09 · Conflicto: eliminar materia prima con historial (DELETE → 409)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 409 Conflict', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
              "pm.test('Protege el historial BPM (lotes y fórmulas)', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.include('lote(s)');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/materias-primas/{{materialConHistorialId}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "materias-primas", "{{materialConHistorialId}}"]
        },
        "description": "MP-001 (Agua Desionizada) tiene lotes recibidos y aparece en fórmulas: el sistema no permite borrarla."
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "codigo", "value": "" },
    { "key": "materialId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "materialConHistorialId", "value": "" }
  ]
}
